WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Raw Drive Rush closes in after light Flash Knuckle.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Luke has moved outside Ken’s throw range before the heavy-punch punish.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:01.900
Standing heavy punch catches the throw recovery as Punish Counter.

4
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.050
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ken.

5
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.150
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.550
Heavy Flash Knuckle follows the light launcher.
